<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Yield Spreads-Hold ground vs U.S..</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Yield Spreads-Hold ground vs U.S..</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> AUD VS   3-YR	   10-YR	* AUD 3-YR/10-YR SPREAD</p>
<p> USD	 82 (- 01)   113 (UNCH) * FUTURES   81   (+ 0.05)</p>
<p> CAD	216 (+ 02)   123 (+ 02) * CASH	68   (UNCH)</p>
<p> NZD	-52 (+ 04)   +13 (+ 03) *</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Australian bond yield spreads to the U.S. stabilised after last week's blow-out and are expected to hold reasonably steady until the wages outlook becomes more clear, analysts.</p>
